          <attvalue for="35" value="0.85" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Greater proxy mobilization (missiles, drones, fast boats and interdictions) produces more direct strikes and interdictions against energy shipping and related maritime infrastructure, raising the measured frequency of attacks." />
