          <attvalue for="36" value="An increase in global advanced chip output raises the commercial availability of components used in drones, loitering munitions, and secure communications that Iran and its proxies can acquire through third‑party suppliers or grey markets, enabling higher proxy operational tempo and geographic spread." />
