          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A sustained increase in crude prices raises export revenue for oil-dependent actors (including Iran), enabling greater financing, weapons procurement, and logistical support for regional proxies, thereby increasing their operational tempo and geographic reach." />
