          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Sustained increases in crude prices raise domestic energy and fiscal burdens in allied countries, producing political pressure to curb expensive overseas assistance and thereby reducing expressed political/diplomatic support for actors in the conflict." />
