          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="More frequent attacks on commercial and military escort vessels produces immediate kinetic responses—escort missions, defensive strikes, and interdictions—raising the aggregate rate and intensity of military engagements in the region." />
