          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Spikes in maritime attacks generate abrupt funding and hedging stress (higher margins, insurance and counterparty risk) in short‑dated money and derivatives markets, which translates into higher market‑implied short‑term rate paths as participants price liquidity and risk premia." />
